  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Christopher C. LaNeve said, \"You can't AI yourself to be the best maneuver brigade commander out there\" (s1). He also stated, \"We won’t be able to AI ourselves into winning a fight\" (s3). In a reported statement dated July 29, 2026, LaNeve said, \"It enables us to do these things distributed\" (s2). On October 5, 2026, LaNeve said that if asked what his number one modernization priority would be, he would say command and control (s4).",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s3",
    "s2",
    "s4"
   ],
   "sentences": [
